      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Poly Shape draws a footprint on the ground, point by point, then extrudes it to a height: a plaza, a platform, an irregular room. The result is a ProBuilder mesh with separate faces for the top, the bottom and each side, so each can carry its own material.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You draw a footprint with five points and extrude it 0.5 m. How many faces will the shape have?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Choose Tools \u203A ProBuilder \u203A Editors \u203A Create PolyShape, click five points in the marked area, then press Enter twice.\n2. In the Poly Shape component, set Extrusion to 0.5.\n3. In Face mode, give the top M_Kit_Stone-Paving and the sides M_Kit_Concrete-Smooth.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal-Kit 2 \xB7 Levels (Platform)</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
