  m_text: "A mesh is a hollow surface, and each face is drawn only from its front.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Move the Scene view camera inside this box. Do you see its walls?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Fly into the box in the Scene view.\n2. Select the box and use Flip Normals.\n3. Look again from inside, and from outside.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 0 \xB7 What a mesh is, Hollow (this scene)</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
