  m_text: "A mesh is made of vertices, edges and faces. ProBuilder lets you select each of them: Vertex, Edge and Face mode.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You extrude the top face of this block once, upwards. How many faces will the block have afterwards?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. In Face mode, select the top face and extrude it up 0.3 m.\n2. Move the new top face back to make a second step.\n3. Extrude again.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal-Kit 2 \xB7 Levels (Stairs)</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
