  m_text: 'The pivot is the point an object moves, rotates and scales around. A door turns around its hinge.


    <b>Predict:</b> Rotate the door 60 degrees around Y. Where does it swing?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Rotate the door and watch. Undo.

    2. In Edge mode, select the hinge edge and use Set Pivot To Selection.

    3. Rotate it again.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: ProBuilder manual, Set Pivot To Selection</color></size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
